UET Abbottabad - Software Construction (Lab Task 07)

Course: Software Construction (5th Semester Software Engineering)[cite: 1]    
Institution: University of Engineering and Technology, Abbottabad Campus[cite: 1]  

Lab # 07: Construction for Reuse: Interfaces, Generics, and Contracts

📌 Lab Objective
Apply enterprise software engineering principles by designing components capable of seamless black-box reuse, generic type safety, 
and contract integrity.

