Repository Structure & Submission Format
Main File: `com.university.lab.lab7.Lab7.java` serves as the main entry point executing all lab tasks.
Packages:
Task1: Black-Box Reuse via Composition and Interfaces (`PaymentMethod`, `CreditCardPayment`, `JazzCashPayment`, `EcommerceCart`)
Task2: Generic Type Safety containers (`DataBox<T>`)
Task3: Liskov Substitution Principle and Contract Integrity (`Rectangle`, `Square`, `Shape`, `FixedSquare`)
Task4: Reusable Ordering Algorithms (`Student` with `Comparable`, `CgpaComparator`)

